## Assets, plugins, and interoperability

- [Fab](https://www.fab.com/): Epic's unified marketplace for 3D models, materials, and plugins. Replaced the Unreal Engine Marketplace and the Quixel Megascans storefront.
- [Datasmith and DCC plugins](https://www.unrealengine.com/plugins): Import plugins for Revit, Rhino, SketchUp Pro, 3ds Max, Archicad, Navisworks, and SolidWorks.

